      \"2011-09-06T17:26:27Z\", \"fingerprint\": \"jklmnop12345678\", \"expires_at\":
      \"2011-09-08T17:26:27Z\", \"user\": { \"login\": \"octocat\", \"id\": 1, \"node_id\":
      \"MDQ6VXNlcjE=\", \"avatar_url\": \"https://github.com/images/error/octocat_happy.gif\",
