      \"X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2026-03-10\" \\ https://api.github.com/credentials/revoke \\ -d
      '{\"credentials\":[\"ghp_1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678\",\"github_pat_0A1B2C3D4E5F6
      G7H8I9J0K_ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456\",\"gho_1234567890abcdef
