      `curl -L \\ -X PATCH \\ -H \"Accept: application/vnd.github+json\" \\ -u
      \"<YOUR_CLIENT_ID>:<YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET>\" \\ -H \"X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2026-03-10\" \\
      https://api.github.com/applications/Iv1.8a61f9b3a7aba766/token \\ -d
      '{\"access_token\":\"e72e16c7e42f292c6912e7710c838347ae178b4a\"}'`\nL139: ####\nL140: \nL141:
      Response\nL142: \nL143: * Example response\nL144: \nL145: * Response schema\nL146: \nL147:
      `Status: 200`\nL148: `{ \"id\": 1, \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/authorizations/1\",
      \"scopes\": [ \"public_repo\", \"user\" ], \"token\":
      \"ghu_16C7e42F292c6912E7710c838347Ae178B4a\", \"token_last_eight\": \"Ae178B4a\",
