      false } }`\nL149: ## cite23†Delete an app token L150: \nL151: OAuth or GitHub application
      owners can revoke a single token for an OAuth application or a GitHub application with an
      OAuth authorization.\nL152: \nL153: ### cite24†Basic authentication for \"Delete an app
